  "_notes_court": "Our additions for the four extra elements (nature, wind, light, dark) are the spore, gust, radiance and shadow sprites, the nature/wind/light/dark sparks, and element_fx (which sprite, spark and fireball ramp each element uses). Not part of the handoff; tuned by eye. R-060 (elemental-vfx skill): steam is shorter-lived than smoke so it vanishes, dust has negative buoy so it settles, and the blood sprite replaces the old CPU burst on player hurt.",
